{"unit_id":"tensorlakeai__dsh-tensorlake-sandbox#card-zh","repo":"tensorlakeai/dsh-tensorlake-sandbox","commit":"5d90a33888641c5fcedb6a78878eb43ee5d0c38d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@tensorlakeai/dsh-sandbox 将 DSH 文件和命令操作接入共享的 Tensorlake 远程 Linux microVM。它替换本地文件与子进程提供器，并注册共享 runtime、文件系统和子进程服务。用户可读取、写入和列出远程文件，启动命令进程及 PTY 终端，并让 Bash 使用同一工作目录。适合需要在 Tensorlake 沙箱中执行 DSH 文件和命令任务的用户。需要 Tensorlake 项目及 TENSORLAKE_API_KEY；默认工作目录为 /home/tl-user/workspace，可通过 DSH_TENSORLAKE_CWD 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:41-51","src/runtime.ts:149-185","src/filesystem/index.ts:142-180","src/subprocess/index.ts:56-118"]}
